WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:23.936
Rap! Rap! Rap!

2
00:00:23.937 --> 00:00:27.007
The judge pounded his desk.

3
00:00:27.008 --> 00:00:30.137
Toad stood with his head bowed.

4
00:00:30.138 --> 00:00:34.869
Everyone in the court looked angry.

5
00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:37.483
"Clerk!" the judge yelled.

6
00:00:37.484 --> 00:00:41.070
"Mr. Toad is the worst criminal I know.

7
00:00:41.071 --> 00:00:43.401
How long can we lock him up?"

8
00:00:43.402 --> 00:00:47.140
"Let me see," said the clerk.

9
00:00:47.141 --> 00:00:49.611
"He stole a car.

10
00:00:49.619 --> 00:00:52.958
He drove very dangerously.

11
00:00:52.959 --> 00:00:56.883
He was rude to the police."

12
00:00:56.884 --> 00:01:01.470
"My friends know I'm not terrible," thought Toad.

13
00:01:01.471 --> 00:01:05.200
But Toad's friends were not there.

14
00:01:05.201 --> 00:01:10.146
"Let me add everything up," said the clerk.

15
00:01:10.147 --> 00:01:13.276
"His penalty is twenty years."

16
00:01:13.277 --> 00:01:16.368
"Excellent!" cried the judge.

17
00:01:16.369 --> 00:01:18.483
"Take him away!"

18
00:01:18.484 --> 00:01:22.933
The police chained Toad's hands and feet.

19
00:01:22.934 --> 00:01:26.151
"Come with us," said a policeman.

20
00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:29.611
They dragged him from the court.

21
00:01:29.612 --> 00:01:34.205
Outside, a crowd shouted at Toad.

22
00:01:34.206 --> 00:01:37.081
"Troublemaker!" said a beaver.

23
00:01:37.082 --> 00:01:41.335
"Car thief!" screamed a chipmunk.

24
00:01:41.336 --> 00:01:44.608
"Bandit!" yelled a skunk.

25
00:01:44.609 --> 00:01:49.157
Children shouted at Toad and sang:

26
00:01:49.158 --> 00:01:51.296
Look at Toad!

27
00:01:51.297 --> 00:01:53.015
He hit the road!

28
00:01:53.016 --> 00:01:58.154
Now he's going to jail!

29
00:01:58.155 --> 00:02:03.335
They dragged Toad to a dark dungeon.

30
00:02:03.336 --> 00:02:08.343
A jailer stood by with a ring of keys.

31
00:02:08.344 --> 00:02:12.006
"Oh no!" cried Toad.

32
00:02:12.007 --> 00:02:20.179
The jailer pushed Toad in and the door clanged shut.
